Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.92,0:22:47.43,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}落叶织就的床沿
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.05,0:22:54.27,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}你为何偏偏要离开我身边？
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.81,0:22:59.98,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}沙粒一点一点
